> References

- Marc Brooker (2015), *Exponential Backoff And Jitter*, AWS Architecture Blog.
  [Original article](https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/architecture/exponential-backoff-and-jitter/).
  The capped-window/full-jitter construction is followed here. Its published
  contention-simulator outcomes are not measurements from this report.
- Paxson, Allman, Chu and Sargent (2011), *Computing TCP's Retransmission
  Timer*, [RFC 6298](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc6298.html), sections
  2.5 and 5.5. Cited to distinguish protocol timer rules from this numeric
  application retry fixture.

